# Marketwatch Phantom: "Whenever another creature you control with power 2 or less enters, this creature gains flying until end
# of turn" (CR 603.2, 611.2a, 702.9b). Bot1 casts the Phantom on turn 1 (Mox Pearl and Mox Jet): its own entering gives it nothing
# ("another"). Bot2's Memnite on turn 2 gives it nothing ("you control"). Bot1's Memnite (power 1) on turn 3 gives it flying, and
# on turn 4 the flying is gone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Marketwatch Phantom
Memnite
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Marketwatch Phantom.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Marketwatch Phantom.Keywords = (absent)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Marketwatch Phantom.Keywords = (absent)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Marketwatch Phantom.Keywords = Flying
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = (absent)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Marketwatch Phantom.Keywords = (absent)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Marketwatch Phantom.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Marketwatch Phantom.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Marketwatch Phantom.Toughness = 2
